OL,3,AThree killed and dozens missing after
OL,4,Afire at Indonesian factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe factory is in Serang district,
OL,7,FBanten province, about 50km (31km) west
OL,8,Fof Jakarta. Authorities have not yet
OL,9,Fdetermined the fire's cause.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
